# Acoustic / BirdNET Observation Foundation v1: real local audio test
# fixtures (a real, third-party-licensed field recording plus generated
# synthetic clips) -- mirrors the existing "model/media artifacts stay
# local, never committed" convention above, not source. See
# tests/fixtures/acoustic/PROVENANCE.md for exactly what belongs here and
# its licensing; `tests/test_acoustic_ingest_real_model.py` skips (never
# fails) when this directory is absent.
tests/fixtures/acoustic/*.wav
tests/fixtures/acoustic/*.mp3

# Local dev-checkout runtime markers (mockingbird/runtime_state.py). A
# development checkout with no MOCKINGBIRD_HOME set resolves its runtime home
# to the repository root itself (runtime.py:resolve_runtime_home), so a real
# `python -m mockingbird` launch writes these small local lifecycle files
# directly here rather than under the already-ignored data/ tree.
/runtime_state.json
/instance_identity.json
